<urn:atm:triage:finding/BA3-QA1-009>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BA3-QA1-009" ;
  triage:title "TaskDisposition::Hold(&'static str) encodes nine hold reasons as string literals rather than a closed HoldReason enum" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (rust-best-practices-agent, RBP-004), PR #1402 @ c13f9bddf, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5643113496. TaskDisposition::Hold(&'static str) encodes nine distinct hold reasons as bare string literals rather than a closed HoldReason enum (mirroring the adjacent EpisodeKind pattern); typo-prone, not exhaustiveness-checked. fenix's ruling (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5643134050): REJECTED by design -- AC3 forbids the HoldReason identifier; string hold reasons are the chosen shape. No fix scheduled." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
